  "solution": [
    "Take $p = 97$. It is between 90 and 100, and it is prime: it isn't divisible by 2, 3, 5 or 7, and $11^2 = 121 > 97$.",
    "So a prime between 90 and 100 exists. $\\blacksquare$"
